|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1x | 0.0% | 0.0% | 250.0 | drawdown (intraday touch) |
| 2x | 0.0% | 8.0% | 306 | drawdown (intraday touch) |
| 3x | 0.4% | 26.7% | 258.0 | drawdown (intraday touch) |

